    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore The Movie Database\r\n\r\nSkim the Movie API JSON response: https://developer.themoviedb.org/reference/configuration-details\r\n\r\nUse the JSON to understand how the data is structured. Then, use AI Tutor to help you modify your code to display different details (like \"runtime,\" \"budget,\" or \"tagline\").\r\n\r\n_Hint: To assist you with prompting AI Tutor, a sample movie API response has been uploaded as a file called `movies.json` in your File Panel._\r\n\r\n:::details [Not sure how to modify the code?]\r\n\r\nTry one of the following prompts:\r\n\r\n- In the file `movies.json`, how do I access the \"vote\\_average\" to show the rating?\r\n- How do I change the code to display the \"release\\_date\" in a more readable format?\r\n- What is the difference between \"popularity\" and \"vote\\_count\"? \r\n:::",
